1
00:00:00,794 --> 00:00:02,584
(Penny:)Bye, guys.

2
00:00:02,796 --> 00:00:04,296
(Leonard:)Bye.

3
00:00:08,594 --> 00:00:11,134
(Sheldon:)Well done, Leonard.

4
00:00:12,598 --> 00:00:14,848
(Sheldon:)The true hero doesn't seek adulation.

5
00:00:15,017 --> 00:00:18,687
(Sheldon:)He fights for right and justice
simply because it's his nature.

6
00:00:19,146 --> 00:00:21,606
(Leonard:)Penny's hooking up
with her jerk of an ex-boyfriend...

7
00:00:21,774 --> 00:00:24,984
(Leonard:)...and I have indelible ink
on my forehead.

8
00:00:25,152 --> 00:00:29,202
That's your badge of honor. They're your,
uh, warrior's wound, if you will.

9
00:00:29,365 --> 00:00:30,865
(Sheldon:)I was wrong.

10
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:34,203
(Sheldon:)Minstrels will write songs about you.

11
00:00:35,955 --> 00:00:37,535
(Penny:)Great.

12
00:00:37,706 --> 00:00:41,416
[SINGING]
There once was a brave lad named Leonard

13
00:00:41,627 --> 00:00:44,757
With a fi-fi-fiddle dee-dee

14
00:00:44,922 --> 00:00:47,762
(Sheldon(sings):)He faced a fearsome giant

15
00:00:47,925 --> 00:00:51,345
(Sheldon(sings):)While Raj just wanted to pee

